1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:09,598
Speaking, task two. Card number 7. You are at the bank. You want to open a bank account. Ask four questions.

2
00:00:10,300 --> 00:00:14,647
You are at the bank. You want to open a bank account.

3
00:00:15,833 --> 00:00:18,265
Good afternoon. How can I help you?

4
00:00:23,467 --> 00:00:29,033
Hello, I want to open an account. How much does the account cost per month?

5
00:00:29,233 --> 00:00:30,967
The account is free of charge.

6
00:00:36,167 --> 00:00:38,633
Will I get a bank card?

7
00:00:38,833 --> 00:00:41,358
Yes, you'll get the card by post within a week.

8
00:00:46,567 --> 00:00:50,100
Can I have online banking?

9
00:00:50,300 --> 00:00:53,324
Yes, online banking is free.

10
00:00:58,533 --> 00:01:00,396
Do I need a passport?

11
00:01:00,600 --> 00:01:03,667
Yes, you need a passport and a residence permit.

12
00:01:03,867 --> 00:01:07,099
Thank you for the information. Goodbye.

13
00:01:07,300 --> 00:01:09,367
Thank you, goodbye.

14
00:01:09,567 --> 00:01:19,452
Practise card 7 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website. The link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
